28:["$","article",null,{"className":"article-body article-body--guide","children":[null,["$","section","1-Internship or PhD: identify the task you actually need",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Internship or PhD: identify the task you actually need"}],[["$","p","The internship eligibility page includes later-stage bachelor’s students, master’s students and bachelor’s/master’s graduates with suitable backgrounds. Enrolled students need home-institution approval. Current or former PhD students are excluded from this internship route. Read the exact categories before treating this as a personal eligibility result.",{"children":"The internship eligibility page includes later-stage bachelor’s students, master’s students and bachelor’s/master’s graduates with suitable backgrounds. Enrolled students need home-institution approval. Current or former PhD students are excluded from this internship route. Read the exact categories before treating this as a personal eligibility result."}],["$","p","The programme description gives a four-to-six-month placement, dependent on research suitability, funding and host-unit space. An internship is not a PhD offer. A student exploring a technique and a graduate ready to pursue a doctoral project therefore have different decisions to make.",{"children":"The programme description gives a four-to-six-month placement, dependent on research suitability, funding and host-unit space. An internship is not a PhD offer. A student exploring a technique and a graduate ready to pursue a doctoral project therefore have different decisions to make."}]],"$undefined",[["$","p",null,{"className":"table-scroll-hint","children":"On a small screen, scroll the table sideways to compare all columns."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-table-wrap","role":"region","aria-label":"Internship or PhD: identify the task you actually need","tabIndex":0,"children":["$","table",null,{"className":"guide-table","children":[["$","caption",null,{"children":"Internship or PhD: identify the task you actually need"}],["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[[["$","th","Your immediate task",{"scope":"col","children":"Your immediate task"}],["$","th","Start with",{"scope":"col","children":"Start with"}],["$","th","Keep separate",{"scope":"col","children":"Keep separate"}]],"$undefined"]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","0",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Gain supervised research experience"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Internship eligibility, placement window and available unit"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Any later PhD admission application"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","1",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Apply for a doctoral degree"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"OIST PhD admission instructions"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Internship dates and application checklist"}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}]}],"$undefined"],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for Internship or PhD: identify the task you actually need","children":[["$","$L5","/scholarships/oist-phd/",{"href":"/scholarships/oist-phd/","children":["Read the separate OIST PhD guide",["$","$L6",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$8:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}],["$","section","2-Build a unit-fit worksheet from evidence you can explain",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Build a unit-fit worksheet from evidence you can explain"}],[["$","p","Read a prospective unit’s current research description and one accessible paper or project summary. Write down the research question in your own words, the method you want to learn, the work you have actually done and the uncertainty you still have. A unit name without that connection gives you little material for a specific statement.",{"children":"Read a prospective unit’s current research description and one accessible paper or project summary. Write down the research question in your own words, the method you want to learn, the work you have actually done and the uncertainty you still have. A unit name without that connection gives you little material for a specific statement."}],"$L2c","$L2d"],"$undefined","$L2e","$undefined","$L2f","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],"$L30","$L31","$L32"]}]
